  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      406.4,
      286.68,
      492.79
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose:- Description of the land or servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.118988037109375,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      494.0,
      286.68,
      584.72
    ],
    "text": "Allotment of land called in extent 0.9315, extent 0.1909 of Hectare shown as Lot 589, 590 in FVP 21 dated 2017.10.23 prepared by the Surveyor General situated in with in the Pradeshiya Sabha limits of Trincomalee No. 229E Kappalthurai Grama Niladhari Division, Divisional Secretariat Division of Town & Gravets, Trincomalee District and bounded as follows. Details Attached.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      586.16,
      286.67,
      636.32
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 589 - Extent: 0.9315 Hectare North Lots: Lot 590; East Lots: Lots 590 and 71; South Lots: Lots 71; West Lots: Lots 71 and 590",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      354.6,
      539.89,
      400.64
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. 590 - Extent: 0.1909 Hectare North Lots: Lot 71; East Lots: Lot 71; South Lots: Lots 589 and 71; West Lots: Lot 71",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039495944976807,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      400.41,
      542.2,
      508.4
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat Trincomalee on the 11th day of February 2019 at 10.00 a. m. And you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 28th day of January 2019, the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.56,
      508.39,
      539.88,
      535.28
    ],
    "text": "All deeds and documents in support of the claims should be produced before me at the inquiry.",
